    Representation.cell(~BackChannels<DY,XH,S,P,C>,~back_value(~DY,~dyv,~XH,~xhv,~S,~sv,~P,~pv,~C,~cv),BackChannels{dy,xhat,shift,product,scale,total,Public.geometry_of([images,channels,height,width],1n,Grid.Outermost{})},Public.geometry_of([images,channels,height,width],1n,Grid.Innermost{}),outer,group)>:
